"Themes available: %ld. The clock shows local macOS time. Minimalism and Minimalism 24 are original 12- and 24-hour themes in light and dark variants. The default is Minimalism 24 — Dark; your saved selection takes priority.\n\nDrag the clock to move it. Use Appearance → Bezel and strap to change the display mode. Clicking the dial does not change its appearance.\n\nRight-click the clock or menu bar icon for settings. Appearance groups size, bezel and hand options; Window groups always on top, position lock and return to screen. Left-click the menu bar icon to toggle Always on top. Interaction appears directly under the model name when controls are available.\n\nLaunch at login starts the app after sign-in. Move the app to Applications first; macOS may require approval in General → Login Items." = "Themes available: %ld. The clock shows local macOS time. Minimalism and Minimalism 24 are original 12- and 24-hour themes in light and dark variants. The default is Minimalism 24 — Dark; your saved selection takes priority.\n\nDrag the clock to move it. Use Appearance → Bezel and strap to change the display mode. Clicking the dial does not change its appearance.\n\nRight-click the clock or menu bar icon for settings. Appearance groups size, bezel and hand options; Window groups always on top, position lock and return to screen. Left-click the menu bar icon to toggle Always on top. Interaction appears directly under the model name when controls are available.\n\nLaunch at login starts the app after sign-in. Move the app to Applications first; macOS may require approval in General → Login Items.";
"Legendary watch models and their color variants: Rolex Submariner, Omega Speedmaster, Cartier Tank, Audemars Piguet Royal Oak and Casio G-Shock. Submariner Date and Royal Oak show the local date; G-Shock shows local digital time, weekday and date. On Moonwatch, click the upper pusher to start, pause or resume the chronograph; the lower pusher stops and resets it. The same controls are in Interaction, including in dial-only mode. Running seconds are at 9, the 30-minute counter at 3, and the 12-hour counter at 6." = "Legendary watch models and their color variants: Rolex Submariner, Omega Speedmaster, Cartier Tank, Audemars Piguet Royal Oak and Casio G-Shock. Submariner Date and Royal Oak show the local date; G-Shock shows local digital time, weekday and date. On Moonwatch, click the upper pusher to start, pause or resume the chronograph; the lower pusher stops and resets it. The same controls are in Interaction, including in dial-only mode. Running seconds are at 9, the 30-minute counter at 3, and the 12-hour counter at 6.";

